<title>USA: Sallie Mae to redeem callable notes.</title>
<headline>Sallie Mae to redeem callable notes.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Student Loan Marketing Association said on Monday that on December 9 it will redeem the following callable notes series in its entirety:</p>
<p>    Interest	Maturity	 Cusip</p>
<p>	8.30	  12/09/99     86387RPY2</p>
<p>Sallie Mae said accrued interest of $41.50 per $1,000 face amount will also be paid on December 9. The notes are worth a par amount of $200 million.</p>
<p>It said principal will be repaid at 100 percent of the face amount. Payment will be made to holders of record as of the close of business December 6, Sallie Mae said.</p>
</text>
